<view class="password-page"><view class="card"><text class="title">{{mode==='change'?'修改密码':'人工核验后重置密码'}}</text><text class="hint">新密码至少8位，包含字母和数字。修改后需重新登录。</text><input wx:if="{{mode==='reset'}}" data-field="credential" bindinput="onInput" value="{{credential}}" placeholder="管理员交给本人的一次性重置凭证"/><input wx:else password data-field="currentPassword" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="当前或初始密码"/><input password data-field="newPassword" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="新密码"/><input password data-field="confirmPassword" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="再次输入新密码"/><button class="btn-primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="submit">确认设置密码</button></view></view>